{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"可达范畴"},2],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"范畴论","text":"范畴论"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"可达范畴"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>设 $\\kappa$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"正则基数","text":"正则基数"}},{"Plain":". 定义 $\\kappa$-<strong>可达范畴</strong> (accessible category) 为具有 $\\kappa$-"},{"Local":{"url":"滤余极限","text":"滤余极限"}},{"Plain":"且由一族 $\\kappa$-"},{"Local":{"url":"可表现对象","text":"紧对象"}},{"Plain":"在 $\\kappa$-"},{"Local":{"url":"滤余极限","text":"滤余极限"}},{"Plain":"下生成的范畴.</p>\n<p>范畴 $\\mathcal C$ 是 $\\kappa$-可达范畴等价于 $\\mathcal C = \\mathsf{Ind}_\\kappa(\\mathcal S)$ 是小范畴的 $\\kappa$-"},{"Local":{"url":"ind-对象","text":"Ind 完备化"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}